WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
A huge crowd follows
Jesus to a quiet place.

2
00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:07.240
They are far from any town,
and they have nothing to eat.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.730
His disciples say: send
them away to buy food.

4
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.010
Jesus answers: you give
them something to eat.

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:18.630
Later, five loaves and two
fish feed five thousand men,

6
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.030
with twelve baskets left over.

7
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.600
So if a crowd is fed, does it
matter whether it really happened?

8
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.610
In this mission, you'll explore what
Christians believe these nature miracles

9
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.400
show about Jesus.

10
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.280
Then you'll test them against the
doubts of the philosopher David Hume,

11
00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.320
and against other arguments.

12
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: weigh up whether it matters
if the nature miracles really happened.
